;; Package tzc380 implements a driver for the ARM TrustZone Address Space
;; Controller TZC-380.
;;
;; Note that the TZASC must be initialized early in the boot process, see
;; TZASC.Bypass for information.
;;
;; The driver is based on the following reference specifications:
;;   - TZC-380 TRM - CoreLink™ TrustZone Address Space Controller TZC-380 - Revision: r0p1
;;
;; This package is only meant to be used with `GOOS=tamago GOARCH=arm` as
;; supported by the TamaGo framework for bare metal Go, see
;; https://github.com/usbarmory/tamago.
(in-ns 'go.github_com.usbarmory.tamago.arm.tzc380) (go/file "tzc380.go" :doc "Package tzc380 implements a driver for the ARM TrustZone Address Space\nController TZC-380.\n\nNote that the TZASC must be initialized early in the boot process, see\nTZASC.Bypass for information.\n\nThe driver is based on the following reference specifications:\n  - TZC-380 TRM - CoreLink™ TrustZone Address Space Controller TZC-380 - Revision: r0p1\n\nThis package is only meant to be used with `GOOS=tamago GOARCH=arm` as\nsupported by the TamaGo framework for bare metal Go, see\nhttps://github.com/usbarmory/tamago.\n" :imports [


